// SCE Mesh §16.4 region-partition liveness E2E zenoh session config.
//
// `scouting/multicast/enabled: false` isolates this test from any
// other zenoh peers on the same host — matches
// `ZenohTestUtils::open_peer`. Without this, zenoh's UDP multicast
// scouting discovers every other live zenoh session regardless of
// TCP port choice, so a DELETE sample from e.g.
// `mesh_zenoh_liveliness_verification` (port 17448) leaks into this
// observer (port 17456) and surfaces as a stray PEER_PARTITIONED
// raise before the test's own drop.
{
  scouting: {
    multicast: {
      enabled: false,
    },
  },
}
